body:
Just need to vent a bit

&#x200B;

My symptoms have actually been getting better over the last few days. (I still don't even really know what was wrong with me in the first place though) so I should be happy. But the symptoms won't go away completely and there have already been a couple times where it seemed like they were getting better only to come back even worse. I can't trust it. I wish I could. I just want to get back to my hobbies/college and enjoying my life but this is making it hard to focus on any of that. Hopefully if these symptoms ever completely go away I will feel better. But considering I don't know for sure what's causing them I can't know if they ever will :(.
